!  The first test optimizes for the ground state energy of the Be atom
!  with a 2 GAS FCI in C2v symmetry using the KR-MCSCF module: 
!           1s inactive
!   GAS 1   2s
!   GAS 2   2p shell
!
!  The MCSCF procedure is followed by a MR-CI calculation.
!
!
!  The second test calculates the ground state energy of the Be atom
!  with a 3 GAS MR-CI in D2h symmetry: 
!   GAS 1   1s + 2s 
!   GAS 2   2p shell
!   GAS 3   virtuals
!
